": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 5, "prompt": "Structure of the device.\nAnswer _____________", "sourcePage": 3, "choices": ["A", "B", "C", "D"], "kind": "question", "offset": 1071, "answer": {"text": "C", "source": {"id": "offline-9bdadcb787fb1522de2e", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 20.pdf", "sha256": "9bdadcb787fb1522de2ea8c6ec4f70ec7184f69d82154ae59736d5a913529881", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/9bdadcb787fb1522de2ea8c6ec4f70ec7184f69d82154ae59736d5a913529881.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/9bdadcb787fb1522de2ea8c6ec4f70ec7184f69d82154ae59736d5a913529881.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 8, "prompt": "What is generally recommended with respect to device sizing?\nAnswer ___________", "sourcePage": 4, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 345, "answer": {"text": "Oversizing by 10 to 20 percent", "source": {"id": "offline-9bdadcb787fb1522de2e", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 20.pdf", "sha256": "9bdadcb787fb1522de2ea8c6ec4f70ec7184f69d82154ae59736d5a913529881", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/9bdadcb787fb1522de2ea8c6ec4f70ec7184f69d82154ae59736d5a913529881.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/9bdadcb787fb1522de2ea8c6ec4f70ec7184f69d82154ae59736d5a913529881.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 9, "prompt": "When will the catheter be introduced into the left upper pulmonary vein?\nAnswer _____________", "sourcePage": 4, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 432, "answer": {"text": "After removal of dilator and guidewire", "source": {"id": "offline-9bdadcb787fb1522de2e", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 20.pdf", "sha256": "9bdadcb787fb1522de2ea8c6ec4f70ec7184f69d82154ae59736d5a913529881", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/9bdadcb787fb1522de2ea8c6ec4f70ec7184f69d82154ae59736d5a913529881.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/9bdadcb787fb1522de2ea8c6ec4f70ec7184f69d82154ae59736d5a913529881.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 10, "prompt": "In how many sizes, the WATCHMAN device is available?\nAnswer ___________", "sourcePage": 4, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 533, "answer": {"text": "Five", "source": {"id": "offline-9bdadcb787fb1522de2e", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 20.pdf", "sha256": "9bdadcb787fb1522de2ea8c6ec4f70ec7184f69d82154ae59736d5a913529881", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/9bdadcb787fb1522de2ea8c6ec4f70ec7184f69d82154ae59736d5a913529881.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/9bdadcb787fb1522de2ea8c6ec4f70ec7184f69d82154ae59736d5a913529881.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 11, "prompt": "What will be the outer diameter of the transseptal access sheath?\nAnswer _______________", "sourcePage": 4, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 614, "answer": {"text": "14 F", "source": {"id": "offline-9bdadcb787fb1522de2e", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 20.pdf", "sha256": "9bdadcb787fb1522de2ea8c6ec4f70ec7184f69d82154ae59736d5a913529881", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/9bdadcb787fb1522de2ea8c6ec4f70ec7184f69d82154ae59736d5a913529881.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/9bdadcb787fb1522de2ea8c6ec4f70ec7184f69d82154ae59736d5a913529881.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "answer-key"}, "page": 1}}, {"number": 12, "prompt": "What is recommended for the effective use of the Watchman Device?\nAnswer _______________", "sourcePage": 4, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 712, "answer": {"text": "Fluoroscopic right and caudal projection", "source": {"id": "offline-9bdadcb787fb1522de2e", "filename": "READING ANSWERS 20.pdf", "sha256": "9bdadcb787fb1522de2ea8c6ec4f70ec7184f69d82154ae59736d5a913529881", "assetPath": "https://githu